Subject: [PATCH 49/53] Nova audit: parol xatosi chiqarmaydi; do'kon va NFC
 tarixi haqiqiy javobdan
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 401 bad_current_password (change-password-direct) sessiyani yopmaydi;
  "Joriy parol noto'g'ri" xabari.
- Do'kon (Android): /api/settings/physical-nfc-pricing dan jismoniy NFC
  karta mahsuloti — narx physicalCardFee, ko'p dona narxlari (tiers) va
  yetkazib berish muddati. Ilgari mavjud bo'lmagan `items` o'qilib do'kon
  doim bo'sh edi. Checkout matni — jismoniy karta (storeBuyOnSitePhysical).
- NFC ID tarixi: /api/records/:code/analytics yig'ma ko'rsatkichlari
  (ko'rishlar, noyob tashrifchilar, harakatlar, kunlar, manbalar).
- O'lik / noto'g'ri shartnomali kod olib tashlandi: ShopRepository
  enabledProviders / startPayment / categories, PayProvider,
  BusinessRepository.search. IAP verify 413 — yakuniy (Premium va
  Ko'tarish).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
